+### `yarn fund-usdc` details
+
+```bash
+yarn fund-usdc                                  # 1000 USDC each to Anvil #0, #1, #2
+yarn fund-usdc --amount 250                     # different amount
+yarn fund-usdc --to 0xabc... --amount 50        # a specific address (also tops up its ETH)
